'>{}</span>", "ja508:18.3": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja508:18.4": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span></p>", "ja508:19.1": "<p><span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja508:19.2": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja508:19.3": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja508:19.4": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span></p>", "ja508:20.1": "<p><span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja508:20.2": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja508:20.3": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja508:20.4": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span></p>", "ja508:21.1": "<p><span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja508:21.2": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja508:21.3": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja508:21.4": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span></p>", "ja508:22.1": "<p><span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja508:22.2": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja508:22.3": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja508:22.4": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span></p></blockquote>", "ja508:23.1": "<p class='endsutta'>{}</p></article>"}, "root_text": {"ja508:0.1": "Jātaka ", "ja508:0.2": "Vīsatinipāta ", "ja508:0.3": "Mātaṅgavagga ", "ja508:0.4": "12. Pañcapaṇḍitajātaka ", "ja508:1.1": "“Pañca paṇḍitā samāgatāttha, ", "ja508:1.2": "Pañhā me paṭibhāti taṁ suṇātha; ", "ja508:1.3": "Nindiyamatthaṁ pasaṁsiyaṁ vā, ", "ja508:1.4": "Kassevāvikareyya guyhamatthaṁ”. ", "ja508:2.1": "“Tvaṁ āvikarohi bhūmipāla, ", "ja508:2.2": "Bhattā bhārasaho tuvaṁ vade taṁ; ", "ja508:2.3": "Tava chandarucīni sammasitvā, ", "ja508:2.4": "Atha vakkhanti janinda pañca dhīrā”. ", "ja508:3.1": "“Yā sīlavatī anaññatheyyā, ", "ja508:3.2": "Bhattucchandavasānugā manāpā; ", "ja508:3.3": "Nindiyamatthaṁ pasaṁsiyaṁ vā, ", "ja508:3.4": "Bhariyāyāvikareyya guyhamatthaṁ”. ", "ja508:4.1": "“Yo kicchagatassa āturassa, ", "ja508:4.2": "Saraṇaṁ hoti gatī parāyanañca; ", "ja508:4.3": "Nindiyamatthaṁ pasaṁsiyaṁ vā, ", "ja508:4.4": "Sakhino vāvikareyya guyhamatthaṁ”. ", "ja508:5.1": "“Jeṭṭho atha majjhimo kaniṭṭho, ", "ja508:5.2": "Yo ce sīlasamāhito ṭhitatto; ", "ja508:5.3": "Nindiyamatthaṁ pasaṁsiyaṁ vā, ", "ja508:5.4": "Bhātu vāvīkareyya guyhamatthaṁ”. ", "ja508:6.1": "“Yo ve pituhadayassa paddhagū, ", "ja508:6.2": "Anujāto pitaraṁ anomapañño; ", "ja508:6.3": "Nindiyamatthaṁ pasaṁsiyaṁ vā, ", "ja508:6.4": "Puttassāvikareyya guyhamatthaṁ”. ", "ja508:7.1": "“Mātā dvipadājanindaseṭṭha, ", "ja508:7.2": "Yā naṁ poseti chandasā piyena; ", "ja508:7.3": "Nindiyamatthaṁ pasaṁsiyaṁ vā, ", "ja508:7.4": "Mātuyāvīkareyya guyhamatthaṁ”. ", "ja508:8.1": "“Guyhassa hi guyhameva sādhu, ", "ja508:8.2": "Na hi guyhassa pasatthamāvikammaṁ; ", "ja508:8.3": "Anipphannatā saheyya dhīro, ", "ja508:8.4": "Nipphannova yathāsukhaṁ bhaṇeyya”. ", "ja508:9.1": "“Kiṁ tvaṁ vimanosi rājaseṭṭha, ", "ja508:9.2": "Dvipadajaninda vacanaṁ suṇoma metaṁ; ", "ja508:9.3": "Kiṁ cintayamāno dummanosi, ", "ja508:9.4": "Nūna deva aparādho atthi mayhaṁ”. ", "ja508:10.1": "“‘Paṇhe vajjho mahosadho’ti, ", "ja508:10.2": "Āṇatto me vadhāya bhūripañño; ", "ja508:10.3": "Taṁ cintayamāno dummanosmi, ", "ja508:10.4": "Na hi devī aparādho atthi tuyhaṁ”. ", "ja508:11.1": "“Abhidosagato dāni ehisi, ", "ja508:11.2": "Kiṁ sutvā kiṁ saṅkate mano te; ", "ja508:11.3": "Ko te kimavoca bhūripañña, ", "ja508:11.4": "Iṅgha vacanaṁ suṇoma brūhi metaṁ”. ", "ja508:12.1": "“‘Paṇhe vajjho mahosadho’ti, ", "ja508:12.2": "Yadi te mantayitaṁ janinda dosaṁ; ", "ja508:12.3": "Bhariyāya rahogato asaṁsi, ", "ja508:12.4": "Guyhaṁ pātukataṁ sutaṁ mametaṁ”. ", "ja508:13.1": "“Yaṁ sālavanasmiṁ senako, ", "ja508:13.2": "Pāpakammaṁ akāsi asabbhirūpaṁ; ", "ja508:13.3": "Sakhinova rahogato asaṁsi, ", "ja508:13.4": "Guyhaṁ pātukataṁ sutaṁ mametaṁ. ", "ja508:14.1": "Pukkusa purisassa te janinda, ", "ja508:14.2": "Uppanno rogo arājayutto; ", "ja508:14.3": "Bhātuñca rahogato asaṁsi, ", "ja508:14.4": "Guyhaṁ pātukataṁ sutaṁ mametaṁ. ", "ja508:15.1": "Ābādhoyaṁ asabbhirūpo, ", "ja508:15.2": "Kāmindo naradevena phuṭṭho; ", "ja508:15.3": "Puttassa rahogato asaṁsi, ", "ja508:15.4": "Guyhaṁ pātukataṁ sutaṁ mametaṁ. ", "ja508:16.1": "Aṭṭhavaṅkaṁ maṇiratanaṁ uḷāraṁ, ", "ja508:16.2": "Sakko te adadā pitāmahassa; ", "ja508:16.3": "Devindassa gataṁ tadajja hatthaṁ, ", "ja508:16.4": "Mātuñca rahogato asaṁsi; ", "ja508:16.5": "Guyhaṁ pātukataṁ sutaṁ mametaṁ. ", "ja508:17.1": "Guyhassa hi guyhameva sādhu, ", "ja508:17.2": "Na hi guyhassa pasatthamāvikammaṁ; ", "ja508:17.3": "Anipphannatā saheyya dhīro, ", "ja508:17.4": "Nipphannova yathāsukhaṁ bhaṇeyya. ", "ja508:18.1": "Na guyhamatthaṁ vivareyya, ", "ja508:18.2": "rakkheyya naṁ yathā nidhiṁ; ", "ja508:18.3": "Na hi pātukato sādhu, ", "ja508:18.4": "guyho attho pajānatā. ", "ja508:19.1": "Thiyā guyhaṁ na saṁseyya, ", "ja508:19.2": "amittassa ca paṇḍito; ", "ja508:19.3": "Yo cāmisena saṁhīro, ", "ja508:19.4": "hadayattheno ca yo naro. ", "ja508:20.1": "Guyhamatthaṁ asambuddhaṁ, ", "ja508:20.2": "sambodhayati yo naro; ", "ja508:20.3": "Mantabhedabhayā tassa, ", "ja508:20.4": "dāsabhūto titikkhati. ", "ja508:21.1": "Yāvanto purisassatthaṁ, ", "ja508:21.2": "guyhaṁ jānanti mantinaṁ; ", "ja508:21.3": "Tāvanto tassa ubbegā, ", "ja508:21.4": "tasmā guyhaṁ na vissaje. ", "ja508:22.1": "Vivicca bhāseyya divā rahassaṁ, ", "ja508:22.2": "Rattiṁ giraṁ nātivelaṁ pamuñce; ", "ja508:22.3": "Upassutikā hi suṇanti mantaṁ, ", "ja508:22.4": "Tasmā manto khippamupeti bhedan”ti. ", "ja508:23.1": "Pañcapaṇḍitajātakaṁ dvādasamaṁ. "}, "variant_text": {"ja508:0.1": "", "ja508:0.2": "", "ja508:0.3": "", "ja508:0.4": "", "ja508:1.1": "", "ja508:1.2": "", "ja508:1.3": "", "ja508:1.4": "Kassevāvikareyya → kassevāvīkareyya (sya1ed, sya2ed); kassa vāvīkareyya (mr) ", "ja508:2.1": "", "ja508:2.2": "", "ja508:2.3": "chandarucīni → chandañca ruciñca (bj, pts-vp-pli1) ", "ja508:2.4": "", "ja508:3.1": "anaññatheyyā → anaññadheyyā (bj, pts-vp-pli1) ", "ja508:3.2": "manāpā → piyā manāpā (sya1ed, sya2ed, mr) ", "ja508:3.3": "", "ja508:3.4": "Bhariyāyāvikareyya → bhariyāyāvīkareyya (sya1ed, sya2ed); bhariyāya vāvīkareyya (mr) ", "ja508:4.1": "Yo → so (bj, sya1ed, sya2ed, pts-vp-pli1) ", "ja508:4.2": "", "ja508:4.3": "", "ja508:4.4": "", "ja508:5.1": "Jeṭṭho → yo jeṭṭho (sya1ed, sya2ed) ", "ja508:5.2": "", "ja508:5.3": "", "ja508:5.4": "", "ja508:6.1": "pituhadayassa → hadayassa (bj) | paddhagū → patthagū (sya1ed, sya2ed); pattagū (mr) ", "ja508:6.2": "", "ja508:6.3": "", "ja508:6.4": "Puttassāvikareyya → puttassāvīkareyya (sya1ed, sya2ed); puttassa vāvīkareyya (mr) ", "ja508:7.1": "", "ja508:7.2": "naṁ → yā taṁ (bj, pts-vp-pli1) ", "ja508:7.3": "", "ja508:7.4": "Mātuyāvīkareyya → mātuyā vāvīkareyya (mr) ", "ja508:8.1": "", "ja508:8.2": "", "ja508:8.3": "Anipphannatā → anipphādāya (bj, pts-vp-pli1); anipphannatāya (sya1ed, sya2ed); ānipphādā (?) ", "ja508:8.4": "Nipphannova → nipphannattho (bj, pts-vp-pli1); nipphannatthova (sya1ed, sya2ed) ", "ja508:9.1": "Kiṁ → kinnu (bj) ", "ja508:9.2": "Dvipadajaninda → dipadinda (bj, sya1ed, sya2ed, pts-vp-pli1) | metaṁ → netaṁ (bj, pts-vp-pli1); te taṁ (sya1ed, sya2ed) ", "ja508:9.3": "", "ja508:9.4": "", "ja508:10.1": "Paṇhe → pañño (bj, pts-vp-pli1); pañhe (sya1ed, sya2ed); panhe (mr) ", "ja508:10.2": "", "ja508:10.3": "", "ja508:10.4": "", "ja508:11.1": "", "ja508:11.2": "", "ja508:11.3": "", "ja508:11.4": "", "ja508:12.1": "", "ja508:12.2": "", "ja508:12.3": "", "ja508:12.4": "", "ja508:13.1": "", "ja508:13.2": "", "ja508:13.3": "", "ja508:13.4": "", "ja508:14.1": "Pukkusa → pakkusa (mr) ", "ja508:14.2": "", "ja508:14.3": "Bhātuñca → bhātucca (bj, pts-vp-pli1); bhātuva (sya1ed, sya2ed) ", "ja508:14.4": "", "ja508:15.1": "", "ja508:15.2": "Kāmindo → kāvindo (bj, pts-vp-pli1) ", "ja508:15.3": "", "ja508:15.4": "", "ja508:16.1": "", "ja508:16.2": "", "ja508:16.3": "Devindassa gataṁ tadajja hatthaṁ → devindassa tadajja hatthagataṁ (mr) ", "ja508:16.4": "", "ja508:16.5": "", "ja508:17.1": "", "ja508:17.2": "", "ja508:17.3": "", "ja508:17.4": "", "ja508:18.1": "", "ja508:18.2": "", "ja508:18.3": "", "ja508:18.4": "", "ja508:19.1": "", "ja508:19.2": "